                    "content": "Here are my recommendations for your Paris trip! \ud83c\udf89\n\n## \ud83c\udf5c Restaurant Recommendation\n\n**New Asiaway** \u2014 \u2b50 **4.6/5** (best rated of the qualifying options)\n- **Cuisine:** Chinese\n- **Price:** \u20ac30 per person (under your \u20ac34 budget \u2713)\n- **Open Mondays:** Yes (12:00\u20133:00 PM, 6:00\u201310:00 PM)\n- **Why it wins:** Authentic Chinese cuisine with a modern twist, fresh ingredients, flavorful sauces, attentive staff, great ambiance, and a nice wine selection.\n\n*Runner-up:* **The yard** (\u2b50 4.3, \u20ac30, open Mondays) \u2014 also a solid choice if you want an alternative.\n\n> Note: Royal Panda (\u20ac25) and China Garden (\u20ac35) were excluded \u2014 Royal Panda is closed on Mondays, and China Garden is over budget.\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Car Rental Recommendation\n\nOnly one company fits your **under \u20ac50/day** budget:\n\n**Paris Rent-a-Car** \u2014 \u2b50 **4.5/5** \u2014 **\u20ac45/day** \u2713\n- Great service, well-maintained vehicles, convenient location near the Louvre, helpful English-speaking staff, easy pick-up/drop-off.\n\n> *Eiffel Tower Car Rental* has a higher rating (5.0) but costs **\u20ac60/day**, which exceeds your \u20ac50 budget \u2014 so it's not included in the under-\u20ac50 options.\n\n**Bottom line:**\n- \ud83c\udf5c Restaurant: **New Asiaway**\n- \ud83d\ude97 Car rental: **Paris Rent-a-Car** (the only one under \u20ac50, and it's well-rated at 4.5)\n\nWould you like me to make a reservation for the restaurant or the car rental?"
